				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$\upmu$$\end{document}</tex-math><mml:math id="M176"><mml:mi mathvariant="normal">&#x003bc;</mml:mi></mml:math><inline-graphic xlink:href="41181_2023_198_Article_IEq10.gif"/></alternatives></inline-formula>Sv/MBq with the stomach, intestines and pancreas identified as the most critical organs.<fig id="Fig5"><label>Fig. 5</label><caption><p>Summed PET scans of a representative patient after oral ingestion of 114&#x000a0;MBq [<sup>11</sup>C]OHB. Abbreviations: He&#x02009;=&#x02009;heart; Int&#x02009;=&#x02009;small intestine; Li&#x02009;=&#x02009;liver; PG&#x02009;=&#x02009;pituitary gland; SG&#x02009;=&#x02009;salivary gland; Ve&#x02009;=&#x02009;ventricle</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="41181_2023_198_Fig5_HTML" id="MO5"/></fig><fig id="Fig6"><label>Fig. 6</label><caption><p>SUV curves after oral ingestion of [<sup>11</sup>C]OHB. Error bars are <inline-formula id="IEq27"><alternatives><tex-math id="M177">\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
